CONFIDENTIALITY OF STATUTORY AND PERSONAL DATA
==============================================

The statutory rule sets under backend/data/seeds/ embody Iranian labour
and tax law as transcribed by the project.  They are legal working
material: the 1404 rule set is the only activated baseline, and the 1405
rule set is an inert placeholder that must not be activated until the
four-eyes verification conditions are met.

The Software handles Iranian identity data — National Codes, mobile
numbers, Sheba numbers and compensation records.  Those data must never
be copied into the repository, an image layer, a log line, an error
message or a traceback.

